                <pb facs="0695" n="615" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg615"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-26"><hi rendition="#italic">July 26,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Powell reports that civil war has been declared; that the cabinet has been
                    dissolved; and that Firmin is marching with an army on Port au Prince.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
